      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24141/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make waffles: Stir together flour, sugar, cocoa, baking powder, and salt in a large mixing bowl. Stir in milk, eggs, and butter until the mixture is smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ei2tZ0SvG6A3-sr9bj9YagMGWl8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24141-chocolate-waffles-i-VAT-step-02-1-a85c0ad870624a90a2cfe213003af2c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24141/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make hard sauce: stir together softened butter, confectioners' sugar, vanilla extract, and milk. Sauce should be fairly stiff. Set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/74pPuFigZZleY-UitHvrGqVANeM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-24141-chocolate-waffles-i-VAT-step-03-ccab55ffdaf04aacbdf42e4d9ef7720c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/24141/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Spray preheated waffle iron with nonstick cooking spray. Pour waffle mix onto hot waffle iron. Cook until golden brown.",
